**Added elements and why:**
- Load balancers (HAProxy) configured as a cluster: a second load balancer takes over if the first fails, so the load balancer is no longer a SPOF.
- Web server, application server and database each on their own server: each component can be scaled, secured and maintained on its own.

**Assumption:** the component split uses 3 separate servers, one for the web server, one for the application server and one for the database, plus the load balancer cluster.
